+
+Hint mode consumes keyboard input until selection or Escape. Backspace edits the hint prefix. Crowded layouts use a picker with Page Up / Page Down. Resizing or changing visible controls cancels hint mode. The local dependency expects RataHop alongside this project at `../ratahop`.
 
 Buttons support mouse clicks. Hold your terminal’s selection modifier (usually Shift) to select/copy text while mouse capture is enabled. Search updates as you type; Enter returns to the results. Choose Follow from a story’s More menu or from the desktop sidebar to populate Following.
 
